 "letter_html": "<section class=\"enc-cd-letter enc-cd-letter--medium\"\n         aria-label=\"LLaMa's read on this race\">\n  <header class=\"enc-cd-letter__head\">\n    <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__mono\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🦙</span>\n    <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__title-block\">\n      <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__eyebrow\">LLaMa&rsquo;s read</p>\n      <h2 class=\"enc-cd-letter__title\">Predicted 1&mdash;2&mdash;3&mdash;4</h2>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <ol class=\"enc-cd-letter__slots\">\n    \n      <li class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot enc-cd-letter__slot--pos-1\">\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__medal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          🥇\n          \n        </span>\n        <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-body\">\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-eyebrow\">\n            Predicted\n            1st\n            \n            \n              &middot; <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__price\">3/1</span>\n            \n          </p>\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__horse\">Charlie Boyo</p>\n          \n            <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-note\">SR-leader at 79, hot trainer at 20% strike rate, steaming market with a track record of shortening predictively. Going fit confirmed; speed is the model&#x27;s strongest positive driver.</p>\n          \n        </div>\n      </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot enc-cd-letter__slot--pos-2\">\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__medal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          🥈\n          \n        </span>\n        <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-body\">\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-eyebrow\">\n            Predicted\n            2nd\n            \n            \n              &middot; <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__price\">4/1</span>\n            \n          </p>\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__horse\">Moe&#x27;s Legacy</p>\n          \n            <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-note\">SR 76, just 1lb off topweight, and only 18 days since his last run — fresh enough, and the speed driver is the model&#x27;s highest positive for him. Each-way claims are real.</p>\n          \n        </div>\n      </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot enc-cd-letter__slot--pos-3\">\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__medal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          🥉\n          \n        </span>\n        <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-body\">\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-eyebrow\">\n            Predicted\n            3rd\n            \n            \n              &middot; <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__price\">11/2</span>\n            \n          </p>\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__horse\">Monsieur Patat</p>\n          \n            <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-note\">Steaming from 5/2F two runs ago down to 11/2 today with a 5lb weight drop. Going is a negative (GF:-) but the market move and form driver keep him honest for a place.</p>\n          \n        </div>\n      </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot enc-cd-letter__slot--pos-4\">\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__medal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          4\n        </span>\n        <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-body\">\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-eyebrow\">\n            Predicted\n            4th\n            \n              &middot; <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__price\">9/1</span>\n            \n          </p>\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__horse\">Army Bugler</p>\n          \n            <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-note\">SR 71 is modest but the going suits (GF:+) and the form driver is positive. The +8lb weight rise is the primary concern keeping him to fourth.</p>\n          \n        </div>\n      </li>\n    \n  </ol>\n\n  \n    <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__verdict\">The bet is Charlie Boyo, win, at 3/1, two units. The confidence band is medium — the SR lead isn&#x27;t dominant, and a Class 5 field with seven runners of unknown pace style always carries noise. But the market compression across three consecutive runs, a yard operating at 20% in the last fortnight, and the best SR in the field point squarely at one horse. I&#x27;m taking 3/1 before it shortens further. On Mr Fox&#x27;s selection, HK Fourteen: I dissent. The class drop is real but the form string (-06846) includes two non-completions and the drift from 4/1 open to current 7/2 tells me the market is not persuaded either. The SR at 75 doesn&#x27;t separate him from the top three, and a yard at 14% with no obvious positive catalyst isn&#x27;t the profile I want to follow at this price.</p>\n  \n\n  \n    <a class=\"enc-cd-letter__more\" href=\"https://www.saturday-racing.com/letters/bath-2026-09-29/1737/\">\n      Read the full letter &rarr;\n    </a>\n  \n</section>\n",
